OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMet Officer dismissed for
OL,4,Aaccessing Wayne Couzens' files
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Metropolitan Police officer who
OL,7,Ftrawled through police systems to
OL,8,Fdiscover the identity of Sarah
OL,9,FEverard's killer following his arrest
OL,10,Fhas been dismissed.
OL,12,FFormer PC Clare Tett had no "proper
OL,13,Fpolicing purpose" to access Wayne
OL,14,FCouzens' record the day after he was
OL,15,Fdetained, a tribunal ruled.
OL,17,FTett had initially maintained that she
OL,18,Fhad a "lawful policing reason" by using
OL,19,FEverard's case to refresh her licence
OL,20,Fon one of the systems.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,325,320,200,140,0,100
