OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMet Officer dismissed for
OL,4,Aaccessing Wayne Couzens' files
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe hearing concluded Tett had no
OL,7,Finvolvement in the investigation into
OL,8,FEverard's disappearance and was instead
OL,9,F"motivated by curiosity". She was found
OL,10,Fto have committed gross misconduct and
OL,11,Fwas dismissed without notice.
